  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p>&lt;5월 26일 개기월식&gt; 관련 기사입니다.&#160;</p><p>저는 학생들에게 안내하고 인증행사를 할까 하고 있습니다^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>한국천문연구원 보도자료 : <a href=\"https://www.kasi.re.kr/kor/publication/post/newsMaterial/28644\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.kasi.re.kr/kor/publication/post/newsMaterial/28644</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"2021년도 주목할 천문현상 |\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t  보도자료  | 고객참여  | 한국천문연구원\" data-og-description=\"정말로 삭제 하시겠습니까? Do you really want to delete?\" data-og-host=\"www.kasi.re.kr\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.kasi.re.kr/kor/publication/post/newsMaterial/28644\" data-og-url=\"https://www.kasi.re.kr/kor/publication/post/newsMaterial/28644\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/YEFia/hyJ6Kq4BSs/zf6eoDzJ3OBwXXDOaX2CuK/img.jpg?width=1877&amp;height=845&amp;face=0_0_1877_845,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ih1dF/hyJ6CNn78Q/x3lj06SQAYFDjbStnoSXV1/img.jpg?width=1287&amp;height=692&amp;face=0_0_1287_692,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cpFhNe/hyJ6DS4iwq/Lp77TYqcZDQ7OUjWhLGOgk/img.jpg?width=650&amp;height=544&amp;face=0_0_650_544\"><a href=\"https://www.kasi.re.kr/kor/publication/post/newsMaterial/28644\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.kasi.re.kr/kor/publication/post/newsMaterial/28644\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/YEFia/hyJ6Kq4BSs/zf6eoDzJ3OBwXXDOaX2CuK/img.jpg?width=1877&amp;height=845&amp;face=0_0_1877_845,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ih1dF/hyJ6CNn78Q/x3lj06SQAYFDjbStnoSXV1/img.jpg?width=1287&amp;height=692&amp;face=0_0_1287_692,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cpFhNe/hyJ6DS4iwq/Lp77TYqcZDQ7OUjWhLGOgk/img.jpg?width=650&amp;height=544&amp;face=0_0_650_544)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">2021년도 주목할 천문현상 |\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t  보도자료  | 고객참여  | 한국천문연구원</p><p class=\"og-desc\">정말로 삭제 하시겠습니까? Do you really want to delete?</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.kasi.re.kr</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>위 내용이 거의 그대로 들어가 있는 한겨레 신물 기사 : <a href=\"https://www.hani.co.kr/arti/science/science_general/975144.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.hani.co.kr/arti/science/science_general/975144.html</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"내년 펼쳐지는 우주쇼…절정은 5월26일 개기월식\" data-og-description=\"1월3일 사분의자리 유성우로 시작해11월19일 부분월식 관측까지 줄이어\" data-og-host=\"www.hani.co.kr\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.hani.co.kr/arti/science/science_general/975144.html\" data-og-url=\"https://www.hani.co.kr/arti/science/science_general/975144.html\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cTlumC/hyJ6yqHt4E/4Eb6BJdzqiecjpYmEAdpR0/img.jpg?width=970&amp;height=518&amp;face=0_0_970_518,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/uVBGc/hyJ6J6LoJU/M6qFE5SMTTJFVrzX6p6kt0/img.jpg?width=970&amp;height=522&amp;face=0_0_970_522,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bSqfav/hyJ6zC69CG/XOadz62SqighsnkCGrko60/img.jpg?width=970&amp;height=437&amp;face=0_0_970_437\"><a href=\"https://www.hani.co.kr/arti/science/science_general/975144.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.hani.co.kr/arti/science/science_general/975144.html\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cTlumC/hyJ6yqHt4E/4Eb6BJdzqiecjpYmEAdpR0/img.jpg?width=970&amp;height=518&amp;face=0_0_970_518,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/uVBGc/hyJ6J6LoJU/M6qFE5SMTTJFVrzX6p6kt0/img.jpg?width=970&amp;height=522&amp;face=0_0_970_522,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bSqfav/hyJ6zC69CG/XOadz62SqighsnkCGrko60/img.jpg?width=970&amp;height=437&amp;face=0_0_970_437)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">내년 펼쳐지는 우주쇼…절정은 5월26일 개기월식</p><p class=\"og-desc\">1월3일 사분의자리 유성우로 시작해11월19일 부분월식 관측까지 줄이어</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.hani.co.kr</p></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/457965353a672e82d8ee71c153c9b49dd467750a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/457965353a672e82d8ee71c153c9b49dd467750a\" data-origin-width=\"648\" data-origin-height=\"542\"><div class=\"figcaption\">2021년 5월 26일 개기월식 (한국천문연구원)</div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>[재과만 월식 관련 이전 글]</p><p>- 개기월식은 항상 붉은 달로 보이나요?(21.4.22.) <a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/1567\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/1567</a></p><p>- 교직원을 위한 월식 관측 행사 안내(15.04.02.) <a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/424t/66\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/424t/66</a></p><p>- 이번 토요일에 개기월식이 일어납니다. (15.03.31.) <a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/424t/66\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/424t/66</a></p><p>- 개기월식(2014.10.8) 사진입니다. <a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/191\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/191</a><b> </b></p><p>&#160;</p><p>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p>&#160;</p><p>학생 안내자료입니다.</p><p>김영학선생님께서 올려주셨던 안내지를 활용하여 만들었습니다.</p><p>(저희는 패들렛 인증으로 진행할 예정이고, 인증한 사람에게 상품 증정하려고 합니다.)</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b47e4017f6e27fbb724d0dfdf46ab7d826490b59?download\" data-file-name=\"5월 26일 개기월식 안내_공유용.hwp\" data-file-size=\"638976\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D227%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20210506010041&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fb47e4017f6e27fbb724d0dfdf46ab7d826490b59')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\"